  "instructions": [
    "Brown the beef in a large pot over medium high heat, then set aside.",
    "Add the chopped onion to the pot and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the chopped Aji amarillo peppers and cook for 2 minutes, until fragrant.",
    "Add the tomato paste and cook, stirring constantly, for 1 minute.",
    "Add the beef broth, browned beef, and salt, then bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the heavy cream and cook for an additional 5 minutes, until the sauce has emulsified.",
    "Stir in the chopped cilantro and lime juice.",
    "Season with black pepper to taste."
